  {"comment": "SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT. Laser sheet's joints (mitcad#1939) with analytic volumes. Two 6 mm plywood plates at a right angle overlapping at the corner: the front 100 x 6 x 60 (36000), the side 6 x 80 x 60 (28800). Finger width 12: five fingers of 12 along the 60 mm edge; the front keeps three (the side loses them wider by the clearance 0.1 at their inner ends: 6 6 36.4 = 1310.4), the side keeps two (the front loses them exactly: 6 6 24 = 864). The fingers fit with 0.1 on each side: 4 gaps of 0.1 6 6 = 14.4 between the plates."},
